  "referenceNumber": "RUS2450",
  "remarks": "\nTATYANA VALENTINOVNA KHOMENKO is an “involved person\" under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019: KHOMENKO is associated with LIMITED LIABILITY COMPANY OPEN SYSTEMS DEVELOPMENT TECHNOLOGY (LLC TROS) by receiving a material benefit from LLC TROS. LLC TROS is an involved person as defined in the regulations.\n",
